   "id": "782c3565",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# STRATEGY 5: FILL with a constant "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ba7e1a6f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Use when: missing means something (e.g. \"no cabin\" is meaningful information)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "29045ac1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df[\"Cabin\"].fillna(\"Unknown\" , inplace=True)\n",
    "df[\"Cabin\"].fillna(0 , inplace=True)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "acaa5070",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# STRATEGY 6: FORWARD FILL / BACKWARD FILL "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dddfa19f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Use when: time series data where previous value is a reasonable estimate"
   ]
